", "id": "823131433883751", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820548_823131437217084_4045434014026278669_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rAfMnd0KOjsQ7kNvwEV1Xua&_nc_oc=AdpX-aWkCLmOOX4OubBZpiUOJ_nkLgdVLKMAGkxjGOT1nqOxJg9JIrkDAqPM7o8SlPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDOE9-d7fjqA7QMq4faoKikXRt0VzjArTS6WYooe7EDng&oe=6A54FB30"}]}, "id": "876902274848449", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SS_6.png", "id": "1316793183465811", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1316793186799144_3949672685485080685_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ice90NJzRBEQ7kNvwGJusj8&_nc_oc=Adoe8keyL0UTmGJ8pvWu0QduYQocXt_TB96aUeSFlLCzbpnFeNJou_VCX0G04YC-qGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBuXu2wW5O1xuNL2vBAfbf-QxCF3Mm2L1s5HxteV8fD-w&oe=6A54F500"}, {"file_name": "SS_2.png", "id": "1261391485820460", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821989_1261391489153793_6026940753607875237_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VczsGOsSjUQ7kNvwG-0sJq&_nc_oc=Adoqx1BIQyuTCjLJCjTfTuoY8HhnvCyz_brcwJh2SqONoApNQzuUxckSiUiug5L_zKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDQJYu1t5iXiFAXdqczlH40Ph9J8L6mR102MR-xz9bGYw&oe=6A54F87B"}, {"file_name": "SS_5.png", "id": "1407246157683316", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304131_1407246161016649_4855231273393496649_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SImNrNBSOkUQ7kNvwH5edOP&_nc_oc=AdrYKryIhaFRQtKmiR4JIs1WgIG8rWLo6hmNASItFw08imYqr9MtjR1qW7SHQpGFJzA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDnt7zfxhjBQrYtHP3QRqyC-jAtJjovV92pLK-vqdBVHw&oe=6A550568"}, {"file_name": "SS_3.png", "id": "1200477738709471", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303672_1200477742042804_4909593580317468805_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I66fiW_TiUwQ7kNvwFfgNrk&_nc_oc=AdoMX88oOwOuUmLAJMDZ2MhYYV5alukNH5S5fuPWGWzxU6xXSssckYiW6fJdCKQ42xI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDoMzF-0OCRmsUykTX-NRzz8ulDKPksZAM_0jPwGFHwig&oe=6A54DF94"}, {"file_name": "SS_1.png", "id": "2010926202812643", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_2010926206145976_8266380978177505109_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GadSXXVB0EIQ7kNvwFRpS2H&_nc_oc=AdpRZrNnINZ0hJLYlMdmGirctnj1ebQ_-qKeO2P0NYXKxfQn5xwRbRO0sSOzztEuVnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD4kUiWjGjj7kOsLgItdylJm_d0PzqfGWyZxTnE8JsTOA&oe=6A54FD79"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Road Ready VR", "keywords": ["Driving", "Simulator", "Practice", "Training", "RoadTest"], "long_description": "Road Ready VR is an educational yet engaging VR driving experience built to help new, beginner, and anxious drivers feel confident behind the wheel.\n\nDesigned as a safe and judgment-free environment, Road Ready VR allows players to learn essential driving skills\u2014such as steering, braking, acceleration, reversing, turning, and parking\u2014through structured lessons and realistic driving scenarios. Players can practice at their own pace, repeat lessons as needed, and gradually build muscle memory without the stress or risk of real-world traffic.\n\n{877732101463625}\n\nWhile Road Ready VR is grounded in education and driver preparedness, it is also designed as an enjoyable and immersive game. Realistic vehicle physics, interactive environments, and scenario-based challenges make learning feel natural and rewarding rather than intimidating.\n\n{1184179947255492}\n\n\ud83d\udea7 Early Access Notice\nRoad Ready VR is currently in Early Access and under active development. You may encounter unintended glitches, incomplete features, or performance issues as we continue improving stability, expanding content, and refining the experience. Player feedback plays a key role in shaping future updates.\n\nOur goal is to bridge the gap between theory and real-world driving by offering a practical, confidence-building VR experience that prepares players to become smarter, calmer, and more capable drivers.\n\n", "short_description": "Road Ready VR is an immersive driving simulator designed to help beginner and anxious drivers build real-world confidence. Learn core driving skills, practice realistic scenarios, and explore safely in VR. This Early Access release is actively evolving, with ongoing improvements, new features, and occasional glitches as we continue development."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fakesouls.com/privacy-policy-road-ready-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fake Souls", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fakesouls.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25840292648907694"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1846513469337430"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1846513469337430"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1767157200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1846513469337430"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27527105220226420", "version": "2.3"}, "id": "1383203160018607", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25840292615574364", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27527105220226420"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1383203160018607"}]}, "change_log": "\u2022 Added Manual Transmission Mode.\n\u2022 Added Walk Mode.\n\u2022 Improved NPC Pedestrian AI.\n\u2022 Steering Wheel Centering Fixed.\n\u2022 Various bug fixes and performance improvements.", "created_date": 1780605669, "id": "27527105220226420", "version": "2.3", "version_code": 23, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25840292615574364", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27527105220226420"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1383203160018607"}]}, "change_log": "\u2022 Added Manual Transmission Mode.\n\u2022 Added Walk Mode (Free Roam).\n\u2022 Improved NPC Pedestrian AI.\n\u2022 Various bug fixes and performance improvements.", "created_date": 1780518792, "id": "27513719704898305", "version": "2.2", "version_code": 22, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25840292615574364", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27527105220226420"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1383203160018607"}]}, "change_log": "Improved highways and expanded map\nHighways have been improved and the map has been expanded, giving players more roads to explore.\n\nMore customization content\nNew items have been added to the Customization Shop, giving players more options to personalize their vehicles.\n\nImproved AI car behavior\nAI traffic now drives more naturally, making roads feel more realistic and active.\n\nDynamic NPC pedestrians added\nPedestrians have been added to the world, making streets feel more alive.\n\nNew Garage system\nA new Garage system has been added, allowing players to manage their vehicles more easily.\n\nNew Customization Shop\nThe Customization Shop has been redesigned to improve the customization experience.\n\nPerformance optimizations and bug fixes\nThe update includes performance improvements, stability fixes, and general bug fixes for a smoother experience.\n\nDrive in and explore the new update.", "created_date": 1779293928, "id": "27332137606389850", "version": "2.1", "version_code": 21, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25840292615574364", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27527105220226420"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1383203160018607"}]}, "change_log": "\ud83d\ude97 Road Ready VR \u2014 Major Garage Update Now Live\n\nThis update brings one of the biggest customization expansions yet to Road Ready VR.\n\n\u2728 New Features:\n\u2022 Added the all-new My Garage system, allowing players to choose and manage their vehicles more easily\n\u2022 Added a brand-new Customization Shop to personalize your car\u2019s appearance and performance\n\u2022 Added interior cabin lighting for a more immersive and premium driving experience\n\u2022 Added new cars with different driving styles and handling feels\n\n\ud83d\udd27 Improvements & Fixes:\n\u2022 Improved overall optimization and stability\n\u2022 Fixed mirror brightness issues for a more realistic driving experience\n\u2022 General polish and quality-of-life improvements across the game\n\nThis update is focused on giving players more freedom, immersion, and personality behind the wheel while continuing to improve performance across supported Meta Quest devices.\n\nMore updates are on the way.", "created_date": 1778618374, "id": "27228833813386897", "version": "2.0", "version_code": 20, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25840292615574364", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27527105220226420"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1383203160018607"}]}, "change_log": "v1.9 is here\u2014smarter, smoother, and more immersive than ever.\n\n- Major Fixes & Performance Boosts\nRear-view mirror distortion resolved, improved hand grab animations, plus multiple bug fixes and overall optimization for smoother gameplay.\n- New Feature: Honk System\nYou can now honk your horn using \u2018A\u2019\u2014because sometimes the road needs to hear you.\n- Improved Sound Experience\nRefined SFX across the board for better realism and performance.\n- Enhanced Road Test Evaluation\nSmarter and more accurate assessment system to better reflect real driving standards.\n- Road Test Fixes\nAddressed multiple issues affecting test flow and consistency.\n- New: Speed Camera FX\nGet real-time feedback with immersive speed camera effects\u2014watch your speed!\n- New Advanced Lessons\nTake your driving skills further with newly added advanced lessons. (More coming soon.)", "created_date": 1775935839, "id": "26871853825751566", "version": "1.9", "version_code": 19, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}